l and bare metal environments</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Flexible\n          <ul class=\"minor\">\n            <li>Containerize a “system”</li>\n            <li>Containerize “application(s)”</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Lightweight\n          <ul class=\"minor\">\n            <li>Just enough Operating System (JeOS)</li>\n            <li>Minimal per container penalty</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Inexpensive\n          <ul class=\"minor\">\n            <li>Open source – free – lower TCO</li>\n            <li>Supported with out-of-the-box modern Linux kernel</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Ecosystem\n          <ul class=\"minor\">\n            <li>Growing in popularity</li>\n            <li>Vibrant community &amp; numerous 3<sup>rd</sup> party apps</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n      <span>5/11/2014</span>\n      <span class=\"version\">Document v2.0</span>\n      <span>5</span>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
